## English summary

**Copyright (c) 2026 Pedro Montezinho. All rights reserved.**

This repository is public so that it can be read. It is **not** open source, and no
licence is granted. You may not use, copy, modify, distribute, sublicense or sell
this code or any part of it without prior written permission, and you may not use
the name **OK4Sticks** to identify any product or service.

You may read the code, use the published application at hoquei.pages.dev free of
charge, and do whatever the GitHub Terms of Service allow a visitor to a public
repository to do, including forking within GitHub itself.

The sports data under `web/static/v1/` and `data-samples/` is derived from a
third-party source. **No rights to that data are granted here**, and none are
claimed beyond the work of collecting, normalising and presenting it.

Nothing here stops anyone from writing their own sports results application from
scratch. Copyright protects this particular expression, not the idea.

External contributions are not accepted at this time; unsolicited pull requests
will be closed unread. For permission requests, write to info.ok4sticks@gmail.com
saying what you want to do and why. The answer may well be yes.

The Portuguese text above prevails in case of divergence.
